+# License
+
+This project's source license is recorded as **MIT**: it is declared in the workspace
+manifest (`Cargo.toml`, `[workspace.package].license = "MIT"`), inherited by every
+crate in `crates/*/Cargo.toml` via `license.workspace = true`, and repeated in the
+Claude Code plugin manifest (`plugin/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`, `"license": "MIT"`).
+There is no standalone `LICENSE` file in the repository and no other license
+decision recorded elsewhere in the project's docs or design materials.
